  "description": {
    "text": "The 2006 Pokémon World Championships, held from 18 to 20 August 2006 at the Hilton Anaheim in California, where 362 players from over 30 countries played in three age divisions. Tropical Tidal Wave returned with new art, Pikachu riding a wave with Munchlax and Psyduck, and every competitor got it in seven languages; top finishers got copies stamped with their placing from Top Thirty-Two up to Finalist, and staff a Staff copy.\n\nThe top three of each division received No. 1 to No. 3 Trainer trophy cards along with crystal trophies.",
